TITLE Equilibration of 100C solution with mineral assemblage and gas phase

SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    units     mmol/kgw
    Ca        50
    pH        7 charge

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite    0  0
    Gypsum     0  0
    Aragonite  0  0

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g)    1.0
    CH4(g)    5.0
    H2S(g)    10.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     calcite_sim.sel
    -reset    false
    -equilibrium_phases  Calcite  Gypsum  Aragonite

END
